 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ b (lane kit-batch-2005b-20261122), hand-authored from w01-88d25 2025-09-25 (re-cropped with a date filter: the archived w01-88 2021-03-29 is the building site). The Akbarstraat E front is nine 3DBAG panels split by the brick door portals: from the south (left in the crop) 117 (the five-storey head over 13.8 m with the garage door, then four storeys), 2, 152, 148, 35, 18, 57, 92 and 67 (five storeys at the north end). Four storeys of tall narrow white-framed windows over a residential ground of paired dark doors; the three middle units carry stacked brick-clad cantilever balconies on storeys 2 and 3. Other fronts were photographed 40+ degrees oblique (w02-269, w04-195, w05-268) and take otherWalls.",
  "The balconies are solid brick-coloured slabs; their glass upper rail and the brick-bond relief round the doors are not modelled."
 ],
